OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize drone from airport
OL,4,Arestricted zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unauthorised drone flying in
OL,7,Frestricted airspace near Luton Airport
OL,8,Fhas been seized by police.
OL,10,FOfficers on duty at Luton's Party in
OL,11,Fthe Park spotted the device being
OL,12,Fpiloted over nearby Alton Road on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FBedfordshire Police said this "breached
OL,16,Fthe airport's flight restriction zone"
OL,17,Fwhich extends over the town centre and
OL,18,Feastern half of Luton and into the
OL,19,Fsurrounding countryside as far as East
OL,20,FHyde, Bendish and King's Walden.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
