OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize drone from airport
OL,4,Arestricted zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA London Luton Airport spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid: "Safety is always our highest
OL,8,Fpriority. Drones can pose a risk when
OL,9,Foperated in restricted airspace or
OL,10,Fclose to aircraft."
